# Hard rule: do not modify `origin/master`-owned classes

This branch tracks `origin/master` for agent logic. Master-owned Kotlin lives under
**`app/src/main/java/com/tcs/vehicleassistant/`** (same paths as `origin/master`) and
must stay byte-identical for allowlisted files.

## Do

- Put UI/UX / TTFR work in **`app/.../assistant/`**, **`com/assistant/ui/`**, and **`com/assistant/api/`**
- Prefer new types under those packages; keep manifest / Koin wiring in `:app`
- After any accidental master-owned edit, restore from `origin/master` into the same `app/src/main/java` path

## Do not

- Edit allowlisted master-owned `.kt` files unless **extremely required**
- Copy or “fix” master agent classes in place — extend via the UX packages above instead

Enforced by `MasterOwnedTreeContractTest` (allowlist of `app/src/main/java/...` paths).
